    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Misri kufwananishwa na mamba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja imbiri ja mori ghwa ikumi na iwi, mwaka ghwa ikumi na iwi ghwa kudwalwa wunyika kodu, BWANA oreghorieghe nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, mlilie mzuri wa Misri kumzere naghamba huwu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nicharisumbua ngolo ra wandu wengi, ingelo nichaakunona aghadi ya iro mbari ra wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wengi wichaturukia kwa agho nichaakubonya, na wazuri wawo wichangilwa ni kiture kwa wundu ghwako, ingelo nakalupiricha lufu lwapo imbiri kwawo; kula ngelo wichakaia wikisughusika, kula umu wawo ukililia irangi jake, ijo ituku ja kutua kwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu, “Mzuri wa Babuloni uchacha na lufu lwake kulwa na oho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichawibonya masikari ghing'etere kufuma kwa iro mbari ra wandu wibwaghe wandu wako wengi. Wandu wako wose, na kula kilambo kukukasire nacho vichatoteshwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wurumwengu ghwa Wafu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja ikumi na isanu, ja mori ghwa imbiri, mwaka ghwa ikumi na iwi ghwa kudwalwa wunyika kodu, BWANA oreghorieghe nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, lilia wandu wengi wa Misri. Kuwisere wandu waro, na wandu wa mbari wikumikie, noko ndonyi cha wurumwengu ghwa wafu, chiaimweri na wandu awo wiseagha cha kinenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ashuru oko aho chiaimweri na izungu jake; makaburi ghawo ghammara chia rose, gha wandu wibwaghilo wudenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makaburi ghawo gheeka kondonyi kinenyi, na agho gha ijeshi jake jerebwaghiloghe wudenyi ghaimara kaburi yake chia rose. Wereserieghe cha wurumwengu ghwa wafu wisemwichi Mlungu. Awo niwo wereoboshereghe wandu wa wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elamu oko aho chiaimweri na izungu jake; makaburi gha wandu wake wose wibwaghilo wudenyi, ghaimara kaburi yake chia rose. Wereserieghe cha wurumwengu ghwa wafu wisemwichi Mlungu. Awo niwo wereoboshereghe wandu wa wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo, na idana niwo wafushwa waya chiaimweri na awo wereserieghe kondonyi kinenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elamu walala aho aghadi ya awo werebwaghiloghe, chiaimweri na izungu ja wandu wake; makaburi ghawo ghikimmara chia rose, nawo wose ni wandu wiseshamishiro wibwaghilo wudenyi. Awo niwo werewioboshereghe wandu wa wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo; nawo wiafushwa waya chiaimweri na awo wiseagha kinenyi, wawikwa chiaimweri na awo werebwaghiloghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mesheki na Tubali weko aho chiaimweri na izungu jawo. Makaburi ghawo ghawimara chia rose; wose ni wandu wisemwichi Mlungu werebwaghiloghe wudenyi, kwa kukaia wereoboshereghe wandu wa wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo ndewerewikiloghe chiaimweri na waja wandu wa kala werekoghe mang'oni, awo wereserieghe Andu kwa Wafu chiaimweri na maswagha ghawo gha wuda, awo chufu rawo rerewikiloghe nandonyi ya vongo vawo, na wuwiwi ghwawo ghuko maindinyi kwawo; kwa kukaia kiture cheobosha cha agho mang'oni cherewiwadieghe awo wandu wa wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo kuchachikanywa na kulala aghadi ya wandu wiseshamishiro, chiaimweri na awo werebwaghiloghe wudenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Edomu oko aho, wazuri wake na wabaa wake wose, awo hata ngera werekoghe mang'oni saki, walale aho chiaimweri na awo werebwaghiloghe wudenyi, na awo wiseshamishiro, na awo wiseagha andenyi ya icho Kina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wabaa wa kaskazinyi wose putu weko aho, na Wasidoni awo weresereloghe aho kwa waya, chiaimweri na awo werebwaghiloghe, angu werewikumbieghe wandu wowa kwa wundu ghwa kudima kwawo; nawo walala wisemwichi Mlungu chiaimweri na awo werebwaghiloghe wudenyi. Waserwa kwa waya chiaimweri na awo wiseagha andenyi ya icho Kina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mzuri wa Misri uchahoreshwa ngolo kwa kuwiwona, angu wandu wake chiaimweri naomoni na ijeshi jake werebwaghiloghe wudenyi. Ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia nerem'bonyereghe Mzuri wa Misri uwioboshe wandu wa ugho wurumwengu ghwa awo wiko moyo, uchararishwa chiaimweri na awo wisemwichi Mlungu na awo werebwaghiloghe wudenyi; ee, uo mzuri moni na izungu jake jose. Ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
